{"id":"u39","kelas":11,"no":5,"judul":"Teks Berita","title":"News Item","emoji":"🗞️","ringkas":"Struktur berita: newsworthy event dan background","ready":true,"goals":["memahami tujuan **news item**: menginformasikan peristiwa **penting dan layak diberitakan** (*newsworthy*)","mengenali struktur: **Headline**, **Newsworthy Event**, **Background Events**, dan **Sources**","menjawab pertanyaan **5W + 1H**: [[what]], [[who]], [[when]], [[where]], [[why]], [[how]]","memakai **simple past** dan **passive voice** dalam berita","memakai kata kerja pelaporan: [[said]], [[reported]], [[stated]], [[according to]]","membaca dan menulis berita sederhana dengan kalimat yang padat"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Berita di koran, situs, televisi, atau media sosial sekolah memakai bahasa yang **singkat, padat, dan faktual**. Pembaca ingin tahu **apa yang terjadi** secepat mungkin. Itulah **news item**, dan unit ini mengajarkan cara membaca serta menulisnya."},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Struktur news item","table":[["Bagian","Fungsi","Contoh"],["**Headline**","judul singkat yang meringkas berita","[[School Wins Cleanest School Award]]"],["**Newsworthy Event**","ringkasan peristiwa utama (5W + 1H)","[[SMA Harapan won the Cleanest School Award on Monday.]]"],["**Background Events**","penjelasan latar dan rincian kejadian","[[The students cleaned the school every Friday for a year.]]"],["**Sources**","kutipan saksi atau pihak berwenang","[[\"We are very proud,\" said the principal.]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"2. Pertanyaan 5W + 1H","table":[["Pertanyaan","Menanyakan","Contoh jawaban"],["**What**","peristiwa apa","[[a fire broke out]]"],["**Who**","siapa yang terlibat","[[two students]]"],["**When**","kapan","[[on Monday morning]]"],["**Where**","di mana","[[at a market in Bandung]]"],["**Why**","mengapa","[[because of an electric problem]]"],["**How**","bagaimana","[[the fire spread quickly]]"]]},{"t":"vocab","title":"3. Kosakata penting","items":[{"en":"headline","id":"judul berita","ex":"The headline is short and clear."},{"en":"report","id":"melaporkan / laporan","ex":"The TV station reported the accident."},{"en":"witness","id":"saksi","ex":"A witness saw the accident."},{"en":"victim","id":"korban","ex":"The victims were taken to hospital."},{"en":"injured","id":"terluka","ex":"Two people were injured."},{"en":"rescue","id":"menyelamatkan","ex":"Firefighters rescued a cat."},{"en":"authorities","id":"pihak berwenang","ex":"The authorities closed the road."},{"en":"accident","id":"kecelakaan","ex":"The accident happened at noon."},{"en":"happen / occur","id":"terjadi","ex":"The fire occurred at night."},{"en":"announce","id":"mengumumkan","ex":"The school announced the winners."},{"en":"spokesperson","id":"juru bicara","ex":"The spokesperson gave a statement."},{"en":"according to","id":"menurut","ex":"According to police, no one was hurt."},{"en":"recent","id":"baru-baru ini","ex":"Recent news says the road is open."},{"en":"breaking news","id":"berita terkini / mendadak","ex":"Breaking news: the bridge is closed."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"4. Simple past dan passive dalam berita","table":[["Bentuk","Contoh"],["**Simple past (aktif)**","[[A fire destroyed three houses.]]"],["**Simple past (pasif)**","[[Three houses were destroyed by a fire.]]"],["**Pasif tanpa pelaku**","[[Two people were injured.]] / [[The road was closed.]]"],["**Past continuous**","[[The bus was travelling to Bogor when it hit a tree.]]"]]},{"t":"warn","title":"Judul berita memakai bentuk ringkas","text":"Headline sering memakai **simple present** untuk kejadian lampau dan menghilangkan *a, an, the, is, are*: [[Fire Destroys Market]] (artinya *A fire destroyed the market*). Di isi berita, kembali pakai **simple past**."},{"t":"grammar","title":"5. Kata kerja pelaporan","table":[["Kata kerja","Contoh"],["**said**","[[\"The road is closed,\" said the police.]] / [[The police said (that) the road was closed.]]"],["**reported**","[[The newspaper reported that the bridge collapsed.]]"],["**stated / announced**","[[The mayor announced that the school would open.]]"],["**according to**","[[According to a witness, the car was moving fast.]]"]]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Teks 1: Fire in a Traditional Market","lines":[{"who":"Headline","en":"Fire Destroys Traditional Market","id":"Kebakaran Menghanguskan Pasar Tradisional"},{"who":"Text","en":"A fire destroyed about 50 stalls at a traditional market in Bandung on Monday night. No one was killed, but three people were slightly injured.","id":"Kebakaran menghanguskan sekitar 50 kios di sebuah pasar tradisional di Bandung pada Senin malam. Tidak ada korban jiwa, tetapi tiga orang terluka ringan."},{"who":"Text","en":"The fire started around 9 p.m. and spread quickly because many stalls were made of wood. Firefighters arrived within ten minutes and controlled the fire after two hours.","id":"Api mulai sekitar pukul 9 malam dan menyebar cepat karena banyak kios terbuat dari kayu. Petugas pemadam tiba dalam sepuluh menit dan mengendalikan api setelah dua jam."},{"who":"Text","en":"According to the police, the fire was caused by an electric problem. \"We are still checking the cause,\" said a police spokesperson.","id":"Menurut polisi, kebakaran disebabkan masalah listrik. \"Kami masih memeriksa penyebabnya,\" kata juru bicara polisi."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog: Membahas berita","lines":[{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"Tom, read the news item and tell me what happened.","id":"Tom, baca berita itu dan ceritakan apa yang terjadi."},{"who":"Tom","en":"A fire destroyed about 50 stalls at a market on Monday night.","id":"Kebakaran menghanguskan sekitar 50 kios di sebuah pasar pada Senin malam."},{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"Good. Why did the fire spread so quickly?","id":"Bagus. Mengapa api menyebar begitu cepat?"},{"who":"Tom","en":"Because many stalls were made of wood.","id":"Karena banyak kios terbuat dari kayu."},{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"Excellent. That is the background event.","id":"Bagus sekali. Itu adalah background event."}]},{"t":"tip","title":"Menulis berita sendiri","text":"Tulis kalimat pertama yang menjawab **what, who, when, where**. Lanjutkan dengan **why** dan **how**. Terakhir, tambahkan kutipan: [[\"...,\" said Ms. Sari.]] Pakai **simple past** dan hindari opini pribadi."},{"t":"summary","items":["News item = menginformasikan peristiwa penting secara **faktual**.","Struktur: **Headline → Newsworthy Event → Background Events → Sources**.","Jawab **5W + 1H**: what, who, when, where, why, how.","Pakai **simple past**, **passive voice**, dan kata pelaporan ([[said]], [[reported]], [[according to]]).","Headline singkat, tanpa artikel dan kata kerja bantu."]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kosakata dengan artinya:","pairs":[["headline","judul berita"],["witness","saksi"],["victim","korban"],["rescue","menyelamatkan"],["injured","terluka"]],"exp":"Kosakata dasar berita.","k":"8983c5d6"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kosakata dengan artinya:","pairs":[["authorities","pihak berwenang"],["accident","kecelakaan"],["spokesperson","juru bicara"],["recent","baru-baru ini"]],"exp":"Kosakata berita.","k":"4d292cfb"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan bagian berita dengan fungsinya:","pairs":[["Headline","judul yang meringkas"],["Newsworthy Event","peristiwa utama"],["Background Events","latar dan rincian"],["Sources","kutipan saksi"]],"exp":"Struktur news item.","k":"bb888a78"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Tujuan news item adalah...","options":["menginformasikan peristiwa penting","menghibur dengan dongeng","menjelaskan cara memasak","mengundang ke pesta"],"answer":0,"exp":"News item menyampaikan kabar.","k":"0003c6ef"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Bagian berita yang berisi kutipan saksi atau pihak berwenang adalah...","options":["sources","headline","background events","newsworthy event"],"answer":0,"exp":"Sources = sumber.","k":"87157b99"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Bagian yang memuat ringkasan peristiwa utama adalah...","options":["newsworthy event","sources","title page","closing"],"answer":0,"exp":"Newsworthy event memuat 5W + 1H.","k":"867dc779"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Tense yang dominan pada isi berita adalah...","options":["simple past","simple present","future","present perfect"],"answer":0,"exp":"Peristiwa sudah terjadi.","k":"d5dd1071"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Informasi \"on Monday night\" menjawab pertanyaan...","options":["when","where","who","how"],"answer":0,"exp":"Waktu = when.","k":"c7e90c92"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Informasi \"at a market in Bandung\" menjawab pertanyaan...","options":["where","when","why","who"],"answer":0,"exp":"Tempat = where.","k":"401243de"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Menurut Teks 1, penyebab kebakaran menurut polisi adalah...","options":["masalah listrik","rokok","petasan","kompor gas"],"answer":0,"exp":"An electric problem.","k":"5910d41b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Menurut Teks 1, mengapa api menyebar cepat?","options":["karena banyak kios terbuat dari kayu","karena angin kencang","karena tidak ada air","karena malam hari"],"answer":0,"exp":"Many stalls were made of wood.","k":"b5b2fd71"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Berapa orang terluka ringan menurut Teks 1?","options":["tiga","lima puluh","sepuluh","dua"],"answer":0,"exp":"Three people were slightly injured.","k":"b6b5489b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Headline yang benar adalah...","options":["Fire Destroys Market","A Fire Is Destroying The Market Yesterday","Market Fire Was Be Destroy","Destroying Market Fire"],"answer":0,"exp":"Headline singkat memakai simple present.","k":"4ba8c61b"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kebakaran terjadi pada hari Senin.","q":"The fire ___ on Monday. (happen)","answers":["happened","occurred"],"hint":"V2","exp":"happened / occurred = terjadi.","k":"ddee3c9d"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dua orang terluka.","q":"Two people ___ injured.","answers":["were"],"hint":"was / were","exp":"were + V3.","k":"42837025"},{"type":"fill","id":"Jalan ditutup oleh polisi.","q":"The road ___ closed by the police.","answers":["was"],"hint":"was / were","exp":"was + V3.","k":"e75be87d"},{"type":"fill","id":"Menurut polisi, tidak ada korban jiwa.","q":"___ to the police, no one was killed.","answers":["according","According"],"hint":"menurut","exp":"According to = menurut.","k":"57be40e9"},{"type":"fill","id":"Polisi mengatakan jalan ditutup.","q":"The police ___ the road was closed.","answers":["said"],"hint":"mengatakan","exp":"said (that) + klausa.","k":"ce85bf47"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Petugas pemadam mengendalikan api.\"","answer":"Firefighters controlled the fire.","exp":"Subjek + V2 + objek.","k":"99c8199f"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Tiga rumah dihancurkan oleh api.\"","answer":"Three houses were destroyed by the fire.","exp":"were + V3 + by.","k":"d999d9fa"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Two people were injured in the accident","options":["Dua orang terluka dalam kecelakaan itu","Dua orang membeli mobil","Kecelakaan itu terjadi kemarin","Tidak ada yang terluka"],"answer":0,"exp":"were injured = terluka.","k":"5d5b69dc"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"According to a witness the car was moving fast","options":["Menurut saksi, mobil itu melaju cepat","Saksi membeli mobil","Mobil itu berhenti","Mobil itu dicuri"],"answer":0,"exp":"according to = menurut.","k":"24664ef9"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Firefighters arrived within ten minutes","options":["Petugas pemadam tiba dalam sepuluh menit","Petugas pemadam pergi pukul sepuluh","Api padam sendiri","Kebakaran terjadi sepuluh kali"],"answer":0,"exp":"within = dalam waktu.","k":"572c9cf0"},{"type":"fill","id":"Para siswa membersihkan sekolah setiap hari Jumat.","q":"The students ___ the school every Friday. (clean)","answers":["cleaned"],"hint":"V2","exp":"cleaned = bentuk lampau.","k":"4a18dbd9"},{"type":"fill","id":"Tidak ada yang terluka.","q":"No one ___ hurt.","answers":["was"],"hint":"was / were","exp":"No one + was.","k":"d513d22f"},{"type":"fill","id":"Bus itu menabrak pohon.","q":"The bus ___ a tree. (hit)","answers":["hit"],"hint":"V2 (sama dengan V1)","exp":"hit - hit - hit.","k":"a71b7c14"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kebakaran dimulai pukul sembilan.","q":"The fire ___ at nine. (start)","answers":["started"],"hint":"V2","exp":"started = bentuk lampau.","k":"edde71da"},{"type":"fill","id":"Jalan itu dibuka kembali kemarin.","q":"The road ___ reopened yesterday.","answers":["was"],"hint":"was / were","exp":"was + V3.","k":"0b3fab73"},{"type":"fill","id":"Korban dibawa ke rumah sakit.","q":"The victims ___ taken to hospital.","answers":["were"],"hint":"was / were","exp":"were + V3.","k":"8292edef"},{"type":"fill","id":"Pemadam kebakaran menyelamatkan seekor kucing.","q":"Firefighters ___ a cat. (rescue)","answers":["rescued"],"hint":"V2","exp":"rescued = menyelamatkan.","k":"6d2f5fa5"},{"type":"fill","id":"Pihak berwenang mengumumkan hasilnya.","q":"The authorities ___ the results. (announce)","answers":["announced"],"hint":"V2","exp":"announced = mengumumkan.","k":"13e46342"},{"type":"fill","id":"Menurut kepala sekolah, lomba itu sukses.","q":"___ to the principal, the contest was a success.","answers":["according","According"],"hint":"menurut","exp":"According to = menurut.","k":"4a4547dc"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat pasif dari \"A fire destroyed the market\" adalah...","options":["The market was destroyed by a fire.","The market destroyed by a fire.","The market is destroyed a fire.","The market were destroyed by a fire."],"answer":0,"exp":"was + V3 + by.","k":"d641e242"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat aktif dari \"The road was closed by the police\" adalah...","options":["The police closed the road.","The police close the road.","The police was closed the road.","The police closing the road."],"answer":0,"exp":"Pelaku menjadi subjek.","k":"643cba4c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang termasuk newsworthy event?","options":["A bus crashed into a tree in Bogor on Friday, injuring ten passengers.","Mix the flour and eggs.","I like buses.","Dear Diary, today I was happy."],"answer":0,"exp":"Ringkas dan memuat 5W.","k":"3aecdb46"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang paling cocok sebagai background event?","options":["The road was wet because it had rained all night.","Bus Crashes in Bogor","\"We are sorry,\" said the driver.","Breaking news"],"answer":0,"exp":"Latar kejadian.","k":"11c86fb0"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang opini sehingga tidak cocok dalam berita?","options":["It was the worst driver in the world.","The bus was travelling at 80 km/h.","Ten people were injured.","The police arrived at noon."],"answer":0,"exp":"Berita harus faktual, bukan opini.","k":"4b9030dd"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Headline mana yang benar?","options":["Flood Hits Village","Flood Is Hitted The Village","A Flood Was Hit Village","Hitting Flood Village"],"answer":0,"exp":"Headline ringkas.","k":"77134b93"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata \"occur\" paling dekat artinya dengan...","options":["terjadi","pergi","menjual","menutup"],"answer":0,"exp":"occur = happen.","k":"aa1b0eda"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"Breaking news\" artinya...","options":["berita terkini","berita lama","berita bohong","berita olahraga"],"answer":0,"exp":"breaking news = berita terkini.","k":"a68789e9"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang benar?","options":["Several houses were damaged by the earthquake.","Several houses was damaged by the earthquake.","Several houses damaged by the earthquake were.","Several houses are damage by the earthquake."],"answer":0,"exp":"houses jamak: were damaged.","k":"505201a2"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Siapa yang berbicara? \"We are checking the cause,\" said the spokesperson.","options":["juru bicara","saksi","korban","pemadam"],"answer":0,"exp":"spokesperson = juru bicara.","k":"431e5ec6"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Apa yang dimaksud dengan \"sources\" dalam berita?","options":["pihak yang dikutip","judul","gambar","nomor halaman"],"answer":0,"exp":"Sources = sumber informasi.","k":"1e018098"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Berita biasanya ditulis dari sudut pandang...","options":["orang ketiga","orang pertama","pembaca","tokoh dongeng"],"answer":0,"exp":"Berita memakai he/she/they.","k":"a6b52944"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Dua orang terluka dalam kecelakaan itu.\"","answer":"Two people were injured in the accident.","exp":"were + V3.","k":"11c50170"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kata dengan artinya:","pairs":[["rescue","menyelamatkan"],["occur","terjadi"],["witness","saksi"],["announce","mengumumkan"]],"exp":"Kosakata berita.","k":"bd43e1be"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"The victims were taken to hospital","options":["Para korban dibawa ke rumah sakit","Para korban pulang","Rumah sakit ditutup","Korban itu pergi sendiri"],"answer":0,"exp":"taken to hospital = dibawa ke rumah sakit.","k":"be69201a"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"We are still checking the cause said the police","options":["Kami masih memeriksa penyebabnya, kata polisi","Polisi pergi memeriksa","Penyebabnya sudah jelas","Polisi tidak peduli"],"answer":0,"exp":"said = kata.","k":"fabc5f9b"},{"type":"fill","id":"Banjir melanda kota kemarin.","q":"A flood ___ the city yesterday. (hit)","answers":["hit"],"hint":"V2 hit","exp":"hit (bentuk lampau sama).","k":"615665f7"},{"type":"fill","id":"Polisi sedang menyelidiki kasus itu.","q":"The police are ___ the case.","answers":["investigating"],"hint":"menyelidiki","exp":"investigating.","k":"41e215f6"},{"type":"fill","id":"Menurut saksi, mobil itu melaju kencang.","q":"___ to witnesses, the car was speeding.","answers":["According"],"hint":"menurut","exp":"According to.","k":"c7f83ea3"},{"type":"fill","id":"Korban dibawa ke rumah sakit.","q":"The victims were ___ to the hospital. (take)","answers":["taken"],"hint":"V3","exp":"were taken.","k":"780fc8a2"},{"type":"fill","id":"Tidak ada yang terluka.","q":"Nobody was ___.","answers":["injured","hurt"],"hint":"terluka","exp":"injured.","k":"e5d086cf"},{"type":"fill","id":"Pemerintah mengumumkan aturan baru.","q":"The government ___ a new rule. (announce)","answers":["announced"],"hint":"V2","exp":"announced.","k":"e5be83ed"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kebakaran terjadi pada Senin pagi.","q":"A fire broke ___ on Monday morning.","answers":["out"],"hint":"pecah","exp":"broke out.","k":"17671985"},{"type":"fill","id":"Petugas pemadam berhasil memadamkan api.","q":"Firefighters managed to ___ out the fire.","answers":["put"],"hint":"memadamkan","exp":"put out.","k":"1dce037f"},{"type":"fill","id":"Penyebab kejadian belum diketahui.","q":"The cause is not yet ___. (know)","answers":["known"],"hint":"V3","exp":"is known.","k":"18911176"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Struktur news item:","options":["newsworthy event – background – sources","goal – steps","thesis – arguments","orientation – complication"],"answer":0,"exp":"News item.","k":"3f0ad05b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Judul berita disebut...","options":["headline","caption","thesis","salutation"],"answer":0,"exp":"headline.","k":"387db848"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Unsur 5W+1H meliputi, kecuali...","options":["Whose favorite color","Who","What","Where"],"answer":0,"exp":"5W1H: who, what, where, when, why, how.","k":"3719523e"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Tense umum berita:","options":["simple past","simple present continuous","future perfect","imperative"],"answer":0,"exp":"Simple past.","k":"6c06e04b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"Eyewitness\" artinya...","options":["saksi mata","korban","pelaku","reporter"],"answer":0,"exp":"eyewitness.","k":"65915edf"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"Suspect\" artinya...","options":["tersangka","saksi","hakim","korban"],"answer":0,"exp":"suspect.","k":"a0f3a118"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat pasif berita:","options":["The building was destroyed by the fire.","The fire destroy the building.","The building destroys.","The fire was destroy."],"answer":0,"exp":"was destroyed.","k":"5eb9b4b4"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Sumber (sources) dalam berita berisi...","options":["komentar saksi/pihak berwenang","resep masakan","cerita fiksi","iklan"],"answer":0,"exp":"Komentar.","k"