":"Kalimat mana yang termasuk background events?","options":["The stalls were made of wood.","Fire Destroys Market","\"We are checking,\" said the police.","Breaking news"],"answer":0,"exp":"Latar dan rincian kejadian.","k":"fd9fdf0c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang paling cocok sebagai sumber (sources)?","options":["\"We are very proud,\" said the principal.","The school won an award.","The students cleaned every Friday.","School Wins Award"],"answer":0,"exp":"Kutipan = sources.","k":"f7c5a115"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Bahasa berita sebaiknya...","options":["faktual dan padat","penuh opini","panjang dan berbelit","berisi perintah"],"answer":0,"exp":"Berita bersifat faktual.","k":"660665d0"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang benar?","options":["The police reported that the road was closed.","The police reports that the road were close.","The police report that the road is closing yesterday.","The police reporting the road closed."],"answer":0,"exp":"reported that + klausa lampau.","k":"763f71ce"},{"type":"fill","id":"Seorang saksi melihat kecelakaan itu.","q":"A ___ saw the accident.","answers":["witness"],"hint":"saksi","exp":"witness = saksi.","k":"b0106efc"},{"type":"fill","id":"Berita itu dilaporkan oleh stasiun TV.","q":"The news was ___ by the TV station.","answers":["reported"],"hint":"V3","exp":"was reported = dilaporkan.","k":"6fcc5345"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Kecelakaan itu terjadi pada siang hari.\"","answer":"The accident happened at noon.","exp":"happened + at noon.","k":"d582b8b9"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan pertanyaan dengan jawabannya:","pairs":[["What?","a fire"],["Who?","two students"],["When?","on Monday"],["Where?","at a market"]],"exp":"5W dalam berita.","k":"b1f57fd3"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"The authorities closed the road","options":["Pihak berwenang menutup jalan itu","Jalan itu panjang","Aku membuka jalan","Jalan itu baru"],"answer":0,"exp":"authorities = pihak berwenang.","k":"234a5ce9"}